rn from each other  just think of next generation eu our  recovery program to counter  the economic consequences of the  pandemic  with this plan the european union has  started to do  something it has never done before on  such a scale  with a strong backing of 27 member  states  the european commission is raising money  on the capital market  and together we will invest billions  in a badly needed joint recovery  we jointly invest to counter the crisis  and make our union  more digital and greener  32 billion euro of next generation eu  are earmarked for the greek recovery  and the commission works hand in hand  with the greek authorities  to make the best use of this unique  opportunity  we want to give the greek economy a  boost  we want to invest in people in jobs  in prosperity and we want to achieve a  better quality of life  for every citizen ladies and gentlemen  constantinos caramanlis the great  statesman  who masterminded greece's accession to  the european union once said  the future of europe lies in its  integration  and the future of greece lies in a  united europe  these words are as true today  as they were 40 years ago so let's use  these wise words as an inspiration for  the next  40 years sarantha honya  pio dinati mazi  you
 

